  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Wild Sage** (1 other source): Volume boost was needed because one verse was sung off mic [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Cutter**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **New Star Song**: back after 86 archived shows (2194 days) [3]\n- **The Hot Garden Stomp**: back after 72 archived shows (2064 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Wild Sage**: back after 30 archived shows (933 days) [3]\n- **Song for an Old Friend**: back after 27 archived shows (828 days) [3]\n- **Attention All Pickpockets**: back after 53 archived shows (1470 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Heretic Pride**: back after 30 archived shows (933 days) [3]\n- **It Froze Me**: back after 63 archived shows (1734 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2011-06-26** (recommended): audience recording; 24 songs; 83 min; rated 2/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Waveform clipping occurs whenever the crowd cheers; Mics placed right at the stage pick up audience singing off-key; reviewer thinks taping from the back would have been better; Recording leans toward the left channel and needs normalizing [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2011-06-26**: taped by Thomas J Hartnett; transferred by Thomas J Hartnett; source: AUD>Core Sound CSB Binaural Microphones>Zoom H2 recorder [1]. Also: Taped from the front of the stage; normalized and boosted in Sound Studio, with no compression added to preserve dynamics [1]",
